NOTES

Artificial Superintelligence (ASI) - a hypothetical level of advanced artificial intelligence that will significantly surpass human intelligence in every respect, from creative ability and scientific discovery to social skills.

A Dyson Swarm - a hypothetical megastructure made up of many independent satellites (solar power stations and mirrors) that form a wide ring around a star to capture the maximum amount of its energy. A modern variant of the older idea of a Dyson sphere.


